venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
.env
# Session logs: logs/pc/ (this machine) and logs/nb/ (the notebook's,
# mirrored here by services/log_receiver.py). They hold viewer names, chat
# and donation messages, and this repo is public — keep them out, or commit
# them to a PRIVATE repo. See logs/README.md.
logs/*
!logs/README.md
# ...except the running table of every game. Numbers and her own phrasing
# only — no voice transcripts, no viewer names — so it is safe in a public
# repo, and it is the thing worth keeping across machines.
!logs/history.csv
